WEBVTT

00:18.290 --> 00:20.460
<i>So this is BUER?</i>

00:33.430 --> 00:35.010
This game's unbeatable!

02:08.860 --> 02:10.990
Buy peace? Now?

02:10.990 --> 02:13.990
A bit of peace for this island, to start.

02:14.410 --> 02:17.080
Buy this island peace with that bravery of yours.

02:17.080 --> 02:18.700
Uh...

02:18.700 --> 02:22.750
Thanks to these morons,
my company's robot is on a rampage.

02:25.210 --> 02:28.500
That's why the city is on the verge of collapse.

02:28.500 --> 02:30.170
Robot?

02:30.170 --> 02:32.050
Its formal name is BUER.

02:32.050 --> 02:35.130
It's a giant boring machine that belongs to my company.

02:35.470 --> 02:37.600
Bowling machine...

02:39.760 --> 02:41.430
Don't let her fool you!

02:41.430 --> 02:44.060
"Boring machine" doesn't even begin to cover—

02:46.230 --> 02:49.270
Will stopping that machine put an end to this mess?

02:49.270 --> 02:53.570
It will! And as it stands,
you're the only one who can do it.

02:53.570 --> 02:55.860
I can do something like that?

02:55.860 --> 02:58.530
With Clarion's help, of course you can.

02:58.950 --> 03:00.120
Clarin?

03:00.700 --> 03:03.160
You two need to work together,

03:03.160 --> 03:05.580
or nobody will be able to stop BUER's rampage.

03:05.580 --> 03:08.710
Oh! Wait, her arm!

03:08.710 --> 03:10.090
Oh, yeah.

03:12.920 --> 03:14.380
Clarin!

03:18.010 --> 03:18.890
So how 'bout it?

03:18.890 --> 03:21.850
Will you unite with Clarion and defeat BUER?

03:21.850 --> 03:23.850
U-U-Unite...

03:24.480 --> 03:26.850
W-With Clarin...

03:26.850 --> 03:29.650
You bet I will, if nobody else can!

03:29.650 --> 03:32.940
Looks like we've reached an agreement. And as for the plan...

03:36.240 --> 03:41.910
The time-limit the Pandora Device imposes sure is unreliable.

03:46.160 --> 03:48.000
Sparkly!

03:48.000 --> 03:52.130
How about we get down to business,
beginning with what I'd like for you to do.

03:52.130 --> 03:54.090
But first, take a look at this.

03:58.090 --> 04:00.850
Clarion, give me BUER's current location.

04:00.850 --> 04:02.560
BUER's position, pinpointed.

04:02.560 --> 04:06.180
Located at the base of subterranean shaft G11,

04:06.180 --> 04:08.900
350 meters below ground near Vulcan City's outer edge.

04:08.900 --> 04:10.690
Wow, that's deep.

04:10.690 --> 04:12.480
This is BUER.

04:12.480 --> 04:13.270
An eyeball?

04:13.270 --> 04:15.860
That gives it a sense of <i>adventure</i>.

04:15.860 --> 04:18.200
Huh? It's stopped moving.

04:25.910 --> 04:27.960
And now it's back to how it was.

04:27.960 --> 04:31.500
Clarion, be a doll and think up
a way for us to neutralize BUER.

04:34.840 --> 04:40.090
The cooling period after BUER fires the charged particle cannon is just over 180 seconds.

04:40.090 --> 04:44.510
Repeated usage causes additional heat and lengthens the cooling period with each subsequent use.

04:44.850 --> 04:47.520
Clarin's so cool.

04:45.140 --> 04:47.520
Taking into account these variables, I propose...

04:47.520 --> 04:50.560
Oh, too technical! Give me something more lively.

04:50.560 --> 04:52.020
Fine.

04:55.110 --> 04:56.280
Now it's cute!?

04:56.610 --> 04:59.820
We begin by moving in and attacking BUER to draw its attention.

05:01.570 --> 05:03.320
This will force it to use its main cannon.

05:04.200 --> 05:07.120
We then take advantage of the resulting cool down to shut it down.

05:07.120 --> 05:07.660
Mhm.

05:07.660 --> 05:08.500
To hell with that!

05:08.500 --> 05:09.870
I wanna go home.

05:09.870 --> 05:10.670
I wanna sleep.

05:11.000 --> 05:14.000
To shut it down, bring up the main console

05:14.000 --> 05:15.670
and use the authentication key.

05:16.590 --> 05:17.670
And the key's right here.

05:17.670 --> 05:19.300
My glasses.

05:19.300 --> 05:20.680
Your glasses!?

05:20.970 --> 05:23.260
That's all I need to do?

05:23.260 --> 05:25.430
No, I'll have Clarion handle that.

05:25.850 --> 05:28.560
You'll be her bodyguard.

05:31.730 --> 05:34.440
Nene will protect Clarion with this.

05:34.440 --> 05:35.730
Took you long enough!

05:35.730 --> 05:38.440
We dug to the vault as fast as we could!

05:39.690 --> 05:41.490
Is this a gun?

05:41.490 --> 05:45.070
It's only a prototype, but it's got punch enough to backup Clarion.

05:45.490 --> 05:46.620
Is it powerful?

05:46.620 --> 05:47.830
More like quick!

05:48.370 --> 05:49.870
Hits as fast as your eyes can track!

05:49.870 --> 05:50.910
This should be sufficient.

05:50.910 --> 05:55.080
Nene, I hope you don't find what I'm about to say offensive,

05:55.080 --> 05:58.210
but this is not equipment that
a real human body could handle.

06:05.050 --> 06:06.550
<i>It's begun to move.</i>

06:06.550 --> 06:09.430
<i>We'll be starting in just a minute...</i>

06:10.890 --> 06:14.060
<i>I'm feel so tense. I need to calm down.</i>

06:17.110 --> 06:19.190
Clarin, isn't this scary?

06:20.820 --> 06:22.950
Yes, by definition.

06:23.490 --> 06:27.120
Buy this island peace with that bravery of yours.

06:27.120 --> 06:27.950
Yeah...

06:28.490 --> 06:31.500
All right, Clarin! As long as I'm with you, I'm not scared at all!

06:31.500 --> 06:32.460
What a bother.

06:33.960 --> 06:36.790
Collapsing buildings! A city in chaos!

06:36.790 --> 06:39.460
A disaster imbued with the choking stench of smoke!

06:39.460 --> 06:42.840
Just what in the world is going on
here on Cenancle Island!?

06:42.840 --> 06:45.380
The truth lies beyond what our eyes can see!

06:45.380 --> 06:47.890
The truth is buried much deeper!

06:47.890 --> 06:50.140
I said truth twice because this truth is truthfully unfortunate!

06:50.140 --> 06:52.730
What conspiracy awaits as we descend into darkness!?

06:52.730 --> 06:54.480
Brought to you by <i>me</i>,

06:54.480 --> 06:57.520
the mighty Titan TV's pride and joy.

06:57.520 --> 07:01.480
Super-duper TV personality and hyper media creator,

07:01.480 --> 07:04.990
Vli—

07:05.990 --> 07:07.370
Only ten more seconds.

07:12.910 --> 07:15.750
Three, two, one...

07:16.500 --> 07:18.040
Let's get it over with!

07:18.040 --> 07:19.500
Here we go!

07:21.340 --> 07:22.510
It's begun.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.760
They run in with their heavy weapons,

07:25.760 --> 07:27.840
and pressure it to fire its main cannon.

07:25.760 --> 07:27.010
Pinhead!

07:27.010 --> 07:28.090
Piece of junk!

07:28.090 --> 07:29.510
Roly poly!

07:30.140 --> 07:31.760
Good luck!

07:36.520 --> 07:37.520
They did it!

07:37.900 --> 07:39.110
It's mad!

07:41.150 --> 07:43.610
Won't they be in danger, acting as the decoys?

07:43.610 --> 07:45.150
Oh, no worries, Nene.

07:45.490 --> 07:47.320
A quick dodge 'n roll and they'll be A-OK!

07:51.280 --> 07:54.040
They'll be A-OK!

07:59.750 --> 08:02.500
BUER has switched to emergency cool down mode.

08:02.500 --> 08:03.550
Now it's time...

08:04.590 --> 08:05.800
for the real thing.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.300
Yeah!

08:24.610 --> 08:27.320
It's like a good luck charm. Be careful.

08:39.330 --> 08:43.380
<i>The defense mechanisms react
indiscriminately to anyone who approaches.</i>

08:49.590 --> 08:51.390
<i>Nene's role...</i>

08:52.640 --> 08:53.600
...is to be Clarin's...

08:57.020 --> 08:58.350
To be Clarin's...

08:58.350 --> 09:00.600
backup!

09:20.660 --> 09:23.380
She's handling it <i>this</i> well without practice?

09:23.380 --> 09:25.420
You don't find someone like this every day.

09:25.420 --> 09:28.960
Hey, managed to dig yourself out of the lab yet?

09:28.960 --> 09:30.880
I just finished!

09:31.880 --> 09:34.390
<i>Well, it looks like we should be okay.</i>

09:43.650 --> 09:45.150
So cool!

09:45.150 --> 09:46.650
Clarion, stop there!

09:53.360 --> 09:56.280
We're in the clear now. Nice shooting, Nene!

09:58.080 --> 09:59.040
Yeah!

09:59.660 --> 10:02.500
There should be an emergency terminal near the very top.

10:02.500 --> 10:06.340
Activate that, and it'll accept external input.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.550
Is this

10:16.470 --> 10:19.560
the main console?

10:20.060 --> 10:23.690
What... the hell... is that?

10:23.690 --> 10:25.310
Wow, rude.

10:25.730 --> 10:28.860
We don't have time to sweat the small details.

10:28.860 --> 10:31.070
Clarion, hurry up and use the key.

10:32.490 --> 10:33.820
"Use"?

10:34.610 --> 10:38.580
Do I... put them on it?

10:44.290 --> 10:45.210
Clari—

10:52.760 --> 10:55.220
Clarin!

11:20.450 --> 11:22.660
Nene! Nene!

11:51.940 --> 11:54.360
<i>The good luck charm means everything will be okay...</i>

12:01.410 --> 12:02.330
<i>So...</i>

12:03.370 --> 12:05.040
<i>Clarin must be!</i>

12:12.290 --> 12:13.920
A direct hit...

12:14.800 --> 12:16.050
Oh, God...

12:16.760 --> 12:17.800
No.

12:17.800 --> 12:19.300
Looks like they made it in time.

12:19.300 --> 12:22.300
Well, yeah! I worked my ass off digging those up!

12:27.430 --> 12:29.560
What's this thing?

12:29.560 --> 12:30.400
An egg?

12:30.400 --> 12:32.560
These things are called Gertsecomma.

12:32.560 --> 12:34.980
They're something akin to pets to Clarion.

12:34.980 --> 12:36.190
Uzal...

12:36.990 --> 12:39.700
I-Is Clarin...

12:39.700 --> 12:41.240
Oh, Clarion's fine.

12:41.240 --> 12:41.950
Huh?

12:41.950 --> 12:44.950
She's the one controlling those things, after all.

12:45.290 --> 12:47.450
Then where is she?

12:47.790 --> 12:48.790
Right there.

12:51.960 --> 12:53.840
She's being crushed!

12:54.880 --> 12:58.970
I'm impressed she managed to backup Nene with her own problems to deal with.

12:58.970 --> 13:03.350
Come to think of it, I told her protecting Nene was her top priority.

13:03.350 --> 13:03.970
No, wait...

13:03.970 --> 13:04.970
Again!?

13:06.970 --> 13:07.730
Oh no.

13:08.060 --> 13:09.980
She's back within BUER's defense zone!

13:09.980 --> 13:12.150
Gertsecommas! Help her!

13:16.650 --> 13:19.240
Nene shouldn't have that kind of mobility.

13:20.070 --> 13:21.410
<i>So that's it...</i>

13:21.410 --> 13:22.870
<i>She's not exactly dodging,</i>

13:22.870 --> 13:27.160
<i>but she's taking advantage of the skill she's using to anticipate where BUER's shots will land.</i>

13:28.950 --> 13:31.000
<i>Is this talent she possesses</i>

13:31.000 --> 13:33.630
<i>not just that of an adepter,</i>

13:33.630 --> 13:36.090
<i>but something else entirely?</i>

13:37.250 --> 13:39.010
I can't get any closer!

13:39.420 --> 13:40.760
Intriguing!

13:41.260 --> 13:42.010
Nene.

13:43.470 --> 13:44.180
Get on.

13:44.180 --> 13:45.140
Clarin?

13:49.850 --> 13:52.230
L-Like this?

14:00.610 --> 14:02.240
I need to get to Clarin fast.

14:02.650 --> 14:04.030
Let me through!

14:07.450 --> 14:08.540
Support.

14:20.050 --> 14:22.260
Clarin!

14:23.260 --> 14:26.760
Are you okay!? Hold on, I'll rescue you!

14:26.760 --> 14:27.510
Ignore that.

14:27.850 --> 14:30.140
Clarion appears to be stuck.

14:30.140 --> 14:32.270
Nene needs to stop BUER.

14:33.770 --> 14:34.520
But...

14:34.900 --> 14:35.770
Hurry.

14:37.770 --> 14:40.110
Clarion puts her hope in Nene.

14:41.570 --> 14:44.360
Now go! For world peace!

14:44.360 --> 14:45.610
Clarin!

14:45.610 --> 14:46.870
I'll give it my all!

14:48.830 --> 14:52.040
She's learning to how to handle Nene really well.

14:52.040 --> 14:56.500
Still, it's shocking to see Clarion holding in her pride and relying on someone else.

14:56.500 --> 14:57.750
Just hang in there!

14:57.750 --> 14:58.750
I'll be back for you!

15:03.880 --> 15:06.260
For Clarin, and for world peace!

15:08.930 --> 15:11.270
I'll stop BUER.

15:14.770 --> 15:17.770
Now to put the glasses on the statue.

15:19.270 --> 15:22.030
Th-The statue! What do I do now!?

15:22.030 --> 15:23.820
Worry not!

15:23.820 --> 15:28.030
A woman as prepared as I planned ahead for a situation like this!

15:29.950 --> 15:31.620
Take your pick, honey!

15:31.620 --> 15:32.790
O-Okay!

15:32.790 --> 15:35.460
You know, if you would have just enabled external operation in the first place...

15:35.460 --> 15:36.540
But the <i>adventure</i>...

15:42.550 --> 15:44.130
Settle down now, you hear?

15:58.650 --> 16:01.570
It stopped, I think?

16:02.150 --> 16:03.530
That girl ain't bad!

16:03.530 --> 16:04.780
We're saved!

16:04.780 --> 16:08.070
Well, well. I saw some interesting stuff today.

16:08.070 --> 16:10.320
I'd love to watch even more...

16:11.780 --> 16:13.580
<i>but now isn't the time.</i>

16:14.660 --> 16:17.080
<i>Things have gotten a little too out of hand.</i>

16:17.080 --> 16:19.080
<i>Oh, well.</i>

16:20.540 --> 16:23.250
Emergency evacuation sequence, initiate.

16:23.250 --> 16:24.210
There.

16:24.590 --> 16:25.260
Fire!

16:28.090 --> 16:31.090
Nene, grab the authentication key.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.100
Roger!

16:33.100 --> 16:36.890
I'm about to detach BUER's Central Nervous Unit,

16:36.890 --> 16:38.980
and I would like you to retrieve it for me.

16:38.980 --> 16:40.940
Central Nervous...

16:40.940 --> 16:42.150
Once you've grabbed it,

16:42.150 --> 16:44.650
go get Clarion and withdraw immediately.

16:44.650 --> 16:45.530
Yes, ma'am!

16:58.120 --> 16:59.750
Hark, mine name is BUER.

17:00.420 --> 17:03.500
Art thou my rescuer from everlasting nightmare?

17:04.000 --> 17:04.960
Um...

17:05.460 --> 17:08.420
Yes, maybe. I'm Nene.

17:08.420 --> 17:09.380
Splendid!

17:09.380 --> 17:11.260
I do commend thee, Nene!

17:11.260 --> 17:13.970
Central Nervous Unit?

17:13.970 --> 17:15.260
'Tis I.

17:16.310 --> 17:17.020
White!

17:19.560 --> 17:20.730
It's moving!?

17:20.730 --> 17:23.400
No! It's not supposed to move anymore!

17:23.400 --> 17:25.820
'Tis but a return to its default state.

17:25.820 --> 17:28.490
Quit moving! You'll crush Clarin!

17:28.490 --> 17:30.110
For a reboot, 'tis necessary.

17:30.110 --> 17:31.280
You can't stop it?

17:31.280 --> 17:35.030
I am a philosopher of hell,
endowed with five legs of the goat,

17:35.030 --> 17:38.580
the head of the lion, and an eternity of knowledge.

17:38.580 --> 17:40.580
Thine request proves simple to I,

17:40.580 --> 17:42.580
with but a glimpse of thine underwear.

17:42.580 --> 17:43.540
Sure!

17:46.840 --> 17:48.380
How easing.

17:53.260 --> 17:55.430
Clarin!

18:07.400 --> 18:09.690
Clarin! Where are you?

18:09.690 --> 18:12.650
Clarin! Clarin!?

18:12.650 --> 18:13.490
Nene?

18:13.490 --> 18:14.660
Clarin?

18:14.660 --> 18:17.830
I used the Gertsecommas as cushioning, but now I'm stuck.

18:18.450 --> 18:20.790
I am located twelve meters above you.

18:42.350 --> 18:45.100
I'm grateful.

18:47.230 --> 18:49.070
Well done, you two.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.230
I can walk on my own.

18:50.230 --> 18:52.030
No way! You can barely stand!

18:52.030 --> 18:53.200
Good job.

18:53.200 --> 18:55.610
A direct contrast to the useless bunch behind me.

18:57.450 --> 18:59.660
Useless, they are, as well as traitors.

18:59.660 --> 19:01.370
I know not what to do with them.

19:01.370 --> 19:03.620
What's up with this ugly little mascot!?

19:03.620 --> 19:07.420
Earth to you useless lot, we're leaving.
Tagging along or not?

19:07.420 --> 19:08.920
We are <i>not</i> useless!

19:08.920 --> 19:12.630
Then I assume you've prepared us
an escape route, my <i>competent</i> little girls?

19:12.630 --> 19:14.630
W-We haven't!

19:14.630 --> 19:15.840
I don't wanna die!

19:15.840 --> 19:17.390
Damn it all!

19:17.390 --> 19:18.140
This way.

19:18.140 --> 19:20.260
Water's leaking in!

19:20.260 --> 19:21.390
This place is done for!

19:21.390 --> 19:23.230
Look how high it's flooded!

19:23.230 --> 19:25.480
This is our grave! It's over for us!

19:25.480 --> 19:26.400
Calm yourself.

19:26.690 --> 19:31.570
Since <i>I'm</i> the competent one here, I secured this emergency elevator in advance.

19:32.650 --> 19:33.650
You meanie!

19:33.650 --> 19:34.900
But we're saved!

19:36.700 --> 19:38.160
Everybody, squeeze in!

19:38.160 --> 19:39.740
Ow!

19:46.710 --> 19:47.420
Huh?

19:47.420 --> 19:50.380
Whoops, we're over the weight limit.

19:51.630 --> 19:53.590
Hidin' all that fat, huh!?

19:53.590 --> 19:54.590
Fatty! Fatty!

19:54.590 --> 19:55.550
Blubber butt!

19:55.550 --> 19:57.880
Oh, well. I guess that's that.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.340
You girls go first.

20:01.640 --> 20:03.310
Huh?

20:03.310 --> 20:04.640
Y-You're kidding, right?

20:04.640 --> 20:07.060
Wait, Sahar! What do you think you're doing!?

20:07.390 --> 20:10.650
You're not the kind of person to sacrifice yourself!

20:10.650 --> 20:12.270
Pulling this at the very end isn't fair!

20:12.770 --> 20:14.610
Sahar!

20:21.780 --> 20:22.700
Nene.

20:22.700 --> 20:23.790
Uzal!?

20:24.290 --> 20:27.410
No worries, I'll be fine.

20:27.410 --> 20:29.500
Sorry for running you ragged today.

20:29.500 --> 20:30.830
Oh, that's okay.

20:30.830 --> 20:33.670
Do you mind waiting until we meet again for your reward?

20:33.670 --> 20:34.920
I don't need to be...

20:34.920 --> 20:40.090
Unfortunately, I don't happen to have any sort of "peace" to sell you right now.

20:40.590 --> 20:41.930
This'll have to do.

20:42.350 --> 20:43.350
Clarion.

20:44.010 --> 20:45.640
Go with Nene.

20:57.320 --> 21:00.660
Nene. Look after Clarion.

21:01.450 --> 21:02.870
I'll make her the happiest girl alive!

21:02.870 --> 21:04.530
What's she talking about?

21:04.950 --> 21:06.330
Thanks a lot!

21:08.460 --> 21:12.420
<i>Some day, you'll be able to buy the world peace you dream of.</i>

21:26.010 --> 21:28.430
Uh, don't worry, Uzal said she'd be all right.

21:28.430 --> 21:30.560
Well, no shit she'll be all right!

21:31.020 --> 21:33.020
She lives any way she damn well pleases!

21:33.020 --> 21:34.690
She's not about to up and die on us!

21:34.690 --> 21:38.400
Someone like her would never die, even if you killed her.

21:43.530 --> 21:45.120
Are we at the surface?

21:45.120 --> 21:47.160
We're safe now, right?

21:47.160 --> 21:49.200
We'll worry about the details later.

21:49.200 --> 21:51.210
For now, let's get somewhere safe!

22:07.220 --> 22:09.520
Huh? What is this?

22:41.010 --> 22:44.010
Accessing the device named nature

22:44.010 --> 22:47.010
The circuit of infinite synapses

22:49.390 --> 22:52.770
Exchanging loops causes inevitable encounters

22:52.980 --> 22:56.400
Clarin, when we use the Pandora Device, do you feel embarrassed too?

22:53.480 --> 23:04.070
{talk}{this is pandoradio, it'll change each week, ignore this segemnt}

22:56.400 --> 22:58.400
I have no need for such an emotion.

22:58.400 --> 23:02.240
Then you aren't embarrassed when I jump on you like this!?

23:02.240 --> 23:03.740
You are impossible to understand.

23:04.070 --> 23:05.450
Saving data

23:05.450 --> 23:06.820
Strengthening predictions

23:06.820 --> 23:09.830
Even my latest updates

23:09.830 --> 23:15.120
can't help explain why you're so nice to me

23:15.120 --> 23:16.710
error error

23:16.710 --> 23:18.210
parameter

23:18.210 --> 23:21.550
Please help me understand

23:21.550 --> 23:23.720
where these emotions came from

23:23.720 --> 23:26.930
Find me at the end of this digital maze

23:26.930 --> 23:29.680
of feelings I can no longer control

23:29.680 --> 23:31.680
I understand the concept of emotions

23:31.680 --> 23:35.060
but I can't make any sense of my own

23:35.440 --> 23:38.060
I want to pull out these cords

23:38.400 --> 23:40.820
and head straight to you

23:40.820 --> 23:43.230
I won't come to understand love

23:43.230 --> 23:46.990
without having you here with me

23:52.790 --> 23:55.830
